<title>SPAIN: RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN RALLY OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN RALLY OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>LLORET DE MAR, Spain 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions</p>
<p>in the Rally of Spain after Monday's opening four special</p>
<p>stages:</p>
